  "semantics": "Lazy rule and resolveId filters keyed by current hook identity and cwd; transform-loader WeakMaps keyed by hook with cwd invalidation. Load loaders read handlers directly without filter caches. Handlers read fresh. In-place filter mutation after first use is a snapshot until hook replacement or cwd change.",
